[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153msessionStorage (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mSurvives reloads, cleared when the tab closes. Per-tab, self-expiring, no stale identity across visits.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m localStorage
     [38;5;246mSurvives browser restarts and is shared across tabs. Best ergonomics; requires an explicit logout that clears it, [39m
     [38;5;246mand persists on shared machines.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m In-memory only
     [38;5;246mModule variable, lost on every reload. Smallest surface, but the user is effectively logged out constantly.[39m
